note Scrolls the offset on both axes by the wheel when the element is hit or under the mouse, then each axis goes through drag_scrollbar, which clamps it to that axis's overflow; an axis the element did not opt into has none, so a vertical column ignores a sideways swipe and a code block ignores the vertical wheel, which the column around it takes.

