note The bar's geometry, shared by drawing and hit-testing: a horizontal track along the bottom of the part of the element that shows, so the Source view's block, which runs past the panel's bottom, still shows its bar at the panel's edge; a block barely showing keeps the bar on its own rows rather than over what is above it.

