note Before the ui sees the frame's input, App::frame passes the pointer through here: while the registry's ShiftWheel gesture for ScrollCode is held (and ControlWheel zoom is not), the vertical wheel is added to the horizontal one and cleared, so every scroller and the graph read shift+wheel as sideways.

