file crates/gui/src/widgets/code.rs
symbol scrolled_code
lines 0 39
hash 5d3c218d89723e6b
note The handler, run as each code block is built: the block's across offset goes through Ui::scroll_by_wheel under the block's id and is queued as ScrollAcross; the block is a clipping row scrolled by that offset that only scrolls and shows a bar sideways, holding one custom leaf at the grid's full width (an exact width, so nothing squeezes it). While the pointer is on the bar, or any scrollbar is being dragged, the block reports no interaction, so a press on the bar neither selects a line nor peeks.

